      "resolved_by_task": "short_query_topic"
    }
  ]
}
```

Do not fabricate claim entries. If you do not have a source extract, the claim is not verified. Unverified entries are useful and should be written honestly.

Also write a compact section brief to `/shared/section_briefs/[short_query_topic].md`. This brief should be the synthesis-ready version of your work:
