- explicit "do not claim" cautions where evidence was weak
Keep this section brief compact: usually 2,000-6,000 characters. Do not paste every note or every claim. The final writer has the claim/extract files for detail.

Also write a compact extract fragment to `/shared/extracts/[short_query_topic].json`. This is what MiniMax M3's long-context final writer will read as part of the ranked evidence packet, so keep it structured and source-close:
